\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 As leader of the government in the upper house, it is common practice for me to deal with multi-parties and know this is something many members of Parliament will be interested in.}{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}
