\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 As I indicated earlier, an important consideration is how inflation expectations and the general inflation psychology in the community evolve. If inflation expectations shift up and businesses and workers come to expect higher rates of inflation on an ongoing basis, it will be harder to return inflation to target \u8211  doing so would require higher interest rates and a sharper slowing in spending. It is in our collective interest that this does not happen.}
