\ulnone\cf2 The timing of being able to act on the recommendations depends on the nature of the recommendations, whether there is a parliamentary aspect to it, whether it requires a different kind of thinking about the appointments and reappointments that are available to government in the course of 2023. It depends on what the panel comes forward with.}
